<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AMERICAN ONCOLOGY RAISED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AMERICAN ONCOLOGY RAISED.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambrecht &amp; Quist Thursday raised its rating on shares of American Oncology Inc to buy from hold due to recent regulatory rulings and a strong June quarter earnings report.</p>
<p>-- raised fiscal 1997 earnings estimate to $0.48 a share from $0.47 and fiscal 1998 to $0.62 a share from $0.59.</p>
<p>-- said market growth in the quarter reached 52 percent.</p>
<p>-- American Oncology shares were off 1/4 to 15-3/4.</p>
</text>
